  <Placemark>
   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued September 5 at 8:55AM PDT until September 7 at 3:00AM PDT by NWS San Francisco CA</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Northwest winds 15 to 20 kt expected.

* WHERE...Waters from Point Pinos to Point Piedras Blancas 10-
60 NM.

* WHEN...From 9 AM Sunday to 3 AM PDT Monday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
