   <name>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 5 at 11:44AM EDT until September 5 at 12:30PM EDT by NWS Morristown TN</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_severe</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>At 1144 AM EDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line
extending from near Bristol TN to near Rogersville, moving southeast
at 30 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Johnson City, Kingsport, Bristol Tn, Greeneville, Elizabethton,
Rogersville, Gate City, Jonesborough, Tusculum, and Surgoinsville.

This includes the following highways...
Interstate 26 in Tennessee between mile markers 1 and 23.
Interstate 81 in Tennessee between mile markers 24 and 75.</Snippet>
