   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...North winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and seas 5
to 9 ft at 7 seconds expected. Conditions will briefly improve
early Tuesday, with steep seas possible again Tuesday afternoon
into Wednesday evening.

* WHERE...South of Port Orford.

* WHEN...From 2 PM Monday to 2 AM PDT Tuesday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds and/or steep seas could capsize or
damage smaller vessels.

* View the hazard area in detail at https://go.usa.gov/x6hks</Snippet>
